omx-contract (3.13.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * release 3.13.0
  * packaging: the package metadata names the Open-Mixer repository
  * scan: SCAN_FIELD_SCOPES names its writers, omx-clap-core's scan and
    plugin-hostd's field dump
  * plugin-face: OMX_PLUGIN_FACE_IDS leaves omx-contract for omx-plugins, its
    one reader
  * roleMeanings: docs, changelog, its code in the Catalan catalog, and the
    verbs fixture on the 3.13.0 floor
  * roleMeanings: a package declares the panel roles it draws and the meaning
    each plays (schema 3.13.0)
  * release: build the DEBs beside the RPMs (#3)
  * workflows: run in Open-Mixer while FreeMixer is restricted
  * versions test: the npm publish guard names omx-contract under whichever
    organization holds it
  * live-owner-data: name a missing GITHUB_REPOSITORY_OWNER before any
    download
  * live-owner-data: the organization is the workflow's
    GITHUB_REPOSITORY_OWNER, with no fallback
  * live-owner-data: read omx-dsp's release from the organization the
    workflow runs in
  * workflows: run in Open-Mixer while FreeMixer is restricted
  * workflows: run in Open-Mixer while FreeMixer is restricted
  * ci: packaging runs on v* tags and workflow_dispatch only

